{"type":"message","id":"8698f4fd","parentId":"94c6f1f9","timestamp":"2026-04-29T17:58:20.286Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"process_1777485497763_37","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== opencli 安装（Web Tools Guide Skill） ===\n\n[INFO] 前置检查...\n[ OK ] 前置检查通过\n\n[INFO] 检查 opencli CLI...\n[INFO] 安装 opencli CLI...\n\nadded 17 packages in 13s\n[ OK ] opencli CLI 安装完成\n\n[INFO] 检查 Browser Bridge 插件...\n[INFO] 尝试下载 Browser Bridge 插件 v1.7.8...\n[WARN] v1.7.8 下载失败，回退到 latest release\n[INFO] 下载 Browser Bridge 插件（latest release）...\n[FAIL] Browser Bridge 插件下载失败，请检查网络或手动下载: https://github.com/jackwener/opencli/releases\n\nProcess exited with code 1."}],"details":{"status":"failed","sessionId":"fresh-crustacean","exitCode":1,"aggregated":"\n=== opencli 安装（Web Tools Guide Skill） ===\n\n[INFO] 前置检查...\n[ OK ] 前置检查通过\n\n[INFO] 检查 opencli CLI...\n[INFO] 安装 opencli CLI...\n\nadded 17 packages in 13s\n[ OK ] opencli CLI 安装完成\n\n[INFO] 检查 Browser Bridge 插件...\n[INFO] 尝试下载 Browser Bridge 插件 v1.7.8...\n[WARN] v1.7.8 下载失败，回退到 latest release\n[INFO] 下载 Browser Bridge 插件（latest release）...\n[FAIL] Browser Bridge 插件下载失败，请检查网络或手动下载: https://github.com/jackwener/opencli/releases\n","name":"bash skills/web-tools-guide/scripts/setup-opencli.sh"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777485500284}}
{"type":"message","id":"0b06ca93","parentId":"8698f4fd","timestamp":"2026-04-29T17:58:22.961Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"♟ Johann, la ejecución del script `setup-opencli.sh` ha fallado.\n\nEl script no pudo descargar el plugin \"Browser Bridge\", que es esencial para que las herramientas de navegación web funcionen correctamente. El mensaje de error sugiere que podría ser un problema de red o de acceso a los repositorios de GitHub desde el entorno donde se ejecuta OpenClaw.\n\nNo puedo continuar con las fases de rastreo y extracción web hasta que este componente esté instalado.\n\nPara solucionar esto, por favor, realiza una de las siguientes acciones:\n\n1.  **Verifica la conexión a internet** del entorno donde se ejecuta OpenClaw.\n2.  **Descarga manualmente el plugin** desde el siguiente enlace y colócalo en la ubicación correcta (si sabes cuál es): `https://github.com/jackwener/opencli/releases`\n\nUna vez que el plugin \"Browser Bridge\" esté disponible, podremos intentar reiniciar la tarea.","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google-native","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":450,"output":344,"cacheRead":49085,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49879,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777485500289,"responseId":"vEbyaZ3eIZ-Hz7IP6Lb5mAY"}}
